Subject: [PATCH v5 6/6] fsl-dma: fix a warning of unitialized cookie
Date: Wed, 1 Aug 2012 16:50:27 +0800
Message-ID: <1343811027-25516-1-git-send-email-qiang.liu@freescale.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.5.1
